{"name":"Secret Affair","hex":"#c41661","fetched":"2026-10-16","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"secret","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A piece of knowledge that is hidden and intended to be kept hidden. .mw-parser-output .defdate{font-size:smaller}","The key or principle by which something is made clear; the knack."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To make or keep secret.","To hide secretly."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/secret"},{"term":"affair","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Something which is done or is to be done; business of any kind, commercial, professional, or public.","Any proceeding or action which it is wished to refer to or characterize vaguely."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/affair"}],"entries":[{"title":"Secret Affair","blocks":[{"text":"Secret Affair are a mod revival band, formed in 1978 and disbanded in 1982 during which period their work is predominantly best-known. They reformed in 2002 and have since then produced an album in 2012."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Secret_Affair"},{"title":"Secret Affair (TV series)","blocks":[{"text":"Secret Affair is a 2014 South Korean television series starring Kim Hee-ae and Yoo Ah-in. It aired on cable channel JTBC from March 17 to May 13, 2014, on Mondays and Tuesdays at 21:50 (KST) for 16 episodes."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/7/74/Secret_Love_Affair-poster.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Secret_Affair_(TV_series)"},{"title":"Affair","blocks":[{"text":"An affair is a relationship typically between two people, one or both of whom are either married or in a long-term monogamous or emotionally-exclusive relationship with another person. The affair can be solely sexual, solely physical, solely emotional, or a combination of these."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Affair"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikime